 {
  "id": "reverse_polarity",
  "description": "Reverse-polarity protection for a 12 V, 1 A input using a P-channel MOSFET so the voltage drop is small, with the gate-source voltage kept within the MOSFET's rating. Input and output on 2-pin headers. Name the nets VIN, VOUT and GND.",
